From: Local integration <local@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] block: preserve the OEM io_context ABI without enabling BFQ

The shipped modules were built with BLK_ICQ enabled. Disabling BFQ must not
remove the ICQ fields from io_context and change transitive symbol CRCs.
This profile retains the existing block-layer infrastructure only; BFQ and
BFQ_GROUP_IOSCHED remain disabled.

--- a/block/Kconfig
+++ b/block/Kconfig
@@ -50,6 +50,7 @@
 
 config BLK_ICQ
 	bool
+	default y
 
 config BLK_DEV_BSGLIB
 	bool "Block layer SG support v4 helper lib"
